@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "zendesk.api"

Feature: Support Schedule Routing
	Testing the support schedule routing of tickets

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I teardown the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I teardown users with the following userExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| User1  |
	* I teardown organizations with the following organizationExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| Organization1 |

Scenario: Set support schedule to HU
	Tickets created for a Hungary Support Organization should be set to the HU Support Schedule.

	Given I create an organization with the following values
	| Status           | Approved            |
	| Name             | Organization Name 1 |
	| Tags             | liferay_dxp         |
	| Shared Tickets   | true                |
	| Shared Comments  | true                |
	| SLA              | Gold                |
	| Tier             | Regular             |
	| Support Region   | Hungary             |
	| Support Language | English             |
	| External ID      | Organization1       |
	And I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk User1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb              |
	| Password         | zendeskqauser                    |
	| Role             | End-user                         |
	| Access           | Organization                     |
	| Email            | zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                |
	| Organization     | Organization Name 1              |
	| Language         | English                          |
	| Time Zone        | Budapest                         |
	| External ID      | User1                            |
	When I create a request as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following values
	| Product                  | prd_liferay_dxp_7_3                              |
	| Component                | apio_architect                                   |
	| System Status            | production_functioning_with_limited_capabilities |
	| Subject                  | Request Subject                                  |
	| Description              | Request Description                              |
	| Organization External ID | Organization1                                    |
	Then the ticket with the ticketId "${staticRequestIdList}" should be set to the "HU" support schedule

